{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34020","headline":"奉和鲁望寄南阳广文次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望寄南阳广文次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春彩融融释冻塘，日精闲咽坐岩房。\n琼函静啓从猨覰，金液初开与鹤尝。\n八会旧文多搭写，七真遗语剩思量。\n不知梦到爲何处，红药满山烟月香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}